{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2006_CyMO-14.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/3/35/2006_CyMO-14.PNG/250px-2006_CyMO-14.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"186\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/3/35/2006_CyMO-14.PNG/375px-2006_CyMO-14.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/3/35/2006_CyMO-14.PNG/500px-2006_CyMO-14.PNG 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/0/0c04b99148a42b3ebdb85702618e7f5ec51597fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB\\Gamma \\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" /> is a small garden divided to the rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/f/adf5cb9dd297d508c931673433ca675e9a739e25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AZE\\Delta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"59\" height=\"14\" /> and to the square <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/6/25664cce82b9d087c9044a13d0fec34a2a1e72fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ZB\\Gamma E$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/3/3a354c3da31cebcac76a35ab4d247e84de56acba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE=2\\sqrt{5}\\ \\text{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"18\" /> and the shaded area of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d21c03d03fb357775cb29a5bc5ff41b181eaa466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta BE$\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/7/aa7059ec2570ff23e0a143b018774d6ed2857fa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\ \\text{m}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" />. The area of the whole garden is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64f0582575dd47900c649f7e65af98d1493ba224.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 24\\ \\text{m}^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 20\\ \\text{m}^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 16\\ \\text{m}^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 32\\ \\text{m}^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 10\\sqrt{5}\\ \\text{m}^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"545\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/1/d21c03d03fb357775cb29a5bc5ff41b181eaa466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta BE$\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" /> is equal to the area of triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dcaddebfb57662bfe6b12b9f39f86f90f3f750a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta AE$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, so the area of rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/0/7600921ff7f393aeabd935c91ae1d7b47953d00e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta AZE$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/5/d8532fea6e90aca51de5a596c8914b62863d4407.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4*2=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"68\" height=\"13\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c416e717f9c797cbde9e0b83ff3b30a378e4509c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AZ=x$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/1/a5144007f55331503b150864b45beb7cce85e37f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XE=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c5319f81d61e4e5ea3602600685fa6060467780.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/5/d350fe0d3d05ac8a851cc80274ba9f84bd6e45eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />. Thus\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/8/1e80799724c14cd9deacd66d61d2bb4cede130a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)^2=x^2+y^2+2xy=36\\Rightarrow x+y=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"19\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45bc0006df273cb384b6c864236b3c1bf292e898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />. So we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b5917b5410023ed368cb4d6d2984df93fcb1e6aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[A\\Delta \\Gamma B]=8+4^2=24\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"234\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><i>Note: The answer theoretically can be 12, since we are not given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/0/a60b84dab57d9a0bf8224d50a2d140e603ea2d6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AZ&lt;ZE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/b/feba091e2aef6f27a3c3abcf0a95fe6d7daba1eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AZ=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/6/d26d1f2f838dfffc19127d054c0c12c3c2e9f936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ZE=2$\" width=\"61\" height=\"12\" />, we have a 2*2 square and a 4*2 rectangle, with a diagonal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8ca5ffe2ef24d79a994eb82757c981c8ea03403d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />. But 12 is not one of the answers included.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/L